# Bringing AI to Students

#### Whe we talk about bringing AI to the students in your school and classroom we can talk about teaching WITH AI or teaching ABOUT AI. 


<br>
<p style="text-align:center;"><img src="https://images.code.org/b83679a5c60b1c90831a4b35461b5103-Screenshot 2026-03-11 at 1.06.25 PM.png" alt="Potential benefits and risks of AI in education."></p>

*Image: TeachAI*


#### Take a look at the chart below to explore some examples of these two concepts and to preview what you'll be learning about in this module.

<body style="margin:0; padding:20px; background-color:#ffffff; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">
<div style="max-width:980px; margin:0 auto;">
<div style="display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:16px;">

<div style="flex:1 1 320px; background-color:#F7F8FA; border-radius:6px; box-sizing:border-box; overflow:hidden;">
<div style="background-color:#8C52BA; color:#ffffff; padding:10px 14px; font-weight:600; font-size:20px;">Teaching <span style="opacity:0.95;">WITH</span> AI</div>
<div style="padding:14px 16px 16px 16px;">

<div style="display:flex; align-items:flex-start; margin-bottom:10px;"><div style="width:30px; height:30px; border-radius:50%; background-color:#e0f4f7; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:16px; margin-right:10px;">💬</div><div style="font-size:16px; color:#333333;"><strong>Asking AI questions</strong> to clarify concepts and explore examples</div></div>

<div style="display:flex; align-items:flex-start; margin-bottom:10px;"><div style="width:30px; height:30px; border-radius:50%; background-color:#e0f4f7; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:16px; margin-right:10px;">🔁</div><div style="font-size:16px; color:#333333;"><strong>Iterating on work</strong> by comparing, critiquing, and improving AI suggestions</div></div>

<div style="display:flex; align-items:flex-start; margin-bottom:10px;"><div style="width:30px; height:30px; border-radius:50%; background-color:#e0f4f7; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:16px; margin-right:10px;">🧩</div><div style="font-size:16px; color:#333333;"><strong>Getting scaffolded support</strong> such as hints, step-by-step guidance, or examples</div></div>

<div style="display:flex; align-items:flex-start; margin-bottom:10px;"><div style="width:30px; height:30px; border-radius:50%; background-color:#e0f4f7; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:16px; margin-right:10px;">📊</div><div style="font-size:16px; color:#333333;"><strong>Checking understanding</strong> through practice questions and self-quizzing</div></div>

<div style="display:flex; align-items:flex-start; margin-bottom:10px;"><div style="width:30px; height:30px; border-radius:50%; background-color:#e0f4f7; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:16px; margin-right:10px;">🎯</div><div style="font-size:16px; color:#333333;"><strong>Using AI purposefully</strong> to enhance — not replace — their own thinking</div></div>

<div style="display:flex; align-items:flex-start; margin-bottom:10px;"><div style="width:30px; height:30px; border-radius:50%; background-color:#e0f4f7; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:16px; margin-right:10px;">📝</div><div style="font-size:16px; color:#333333;"><strong>Documenting and reflecting</strong> on how AI contributed to their learning</div></div>

<div style="display:flex; align-items:flex-start;"><div style="width:30px; height:30px; border-radius:50%; background-color:#e0f4f7; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:16px; margin-right:10px;">🧠</div><div style="font-size:16px; color:#333333;"><strong>Maintaining ownership</strong> of ideas, decisions, and final work</div></div>

</div>
</div>

<div style="flex:1 1 320px; background-color:#F7F8FA; border-radius:6px; box-sizing:border-box; overflow:hidden;">
<div style="background-color:#8C52BA; color:#ffffff; padding:10px 14px; font-weight:600; font-size:20px;">Teaching <span style="opacity:0.95;">ABOUT</span> AI</div>
<div style="padding:14px 16px 16px 16px;">

<div style="display:flex; align-items:flex-start; margin-bottom:10px;"><div style="width:30px; height:30px; border-radius:50%; background-color:#e0f4f7; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:16px; margin-right:10px;">🧠</div><div style="font-size:16px; color:#333333;"><strong>Explaining core ideas</strong> (data, models, training, prediction, limitations)</div></div>

<div style="display:flex; align-items:flex-start; margin-bottom:10px;"><div style="width:30px; height:30px; border-radius:50%; background-color:#e0f4f7; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:16px; margin-right:10px;">🧪</div><div style="font-size:16px; color:#333333;"><strong>Building skills to evaluate AI</strong> (accuracy, evidence, bias, hallucinations)</div></div>

<div style="display:flex; align-items:flex-start; margin-bottom:10px;"><div style="width:30px; height:30px; border-radius:50%; background-color:#e0f4f7; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:16px; margin-right:10px;">🗣️</div><div style="font-size:16px; color:#333333;"><strong>Practicing effective prompting and iteration</strong> with reflection and documentation</div></div>

<div style="display:flex; align-items:flex-start; margin-bottom:10px;"><div style="width:30px; height:30px; border-radius:50%; background-color:#e0f4f7; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:16px; margin-right:10px;">🧑‍⚖️</div><div style="font-size:16px; color:#333333;"><strong>Discussing ethics and impacts</strong> (privacy, fairness, labor, misinformation)</div></div>

<div style="display:flex; align-items:flex-start; margin-bottom:10px;"><div style="width:30px; height:30px; border-radius:50%; background-color:#e0f4f7; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:16px; margin-right:10px;">🛡️</div><div style="font-size:16px; color:#333333;"><strong>Teaching safe and responsible use</strong> (policies, citation, transparency)</div></div>

<div style="display:flex; align-items:flex-start; margin-bottom:10px;"><div style="width:30px; height:30px; border-radius:50%; background-color:#e0f4f7; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:16px; margin-right:10px;">🔬</div><div style="font-size:16px; color:#333333;"><strong>Hands-on exploration</strong> with simple models, datasets, and real examples</div></div>

<div style="display:flex; align-items:flex-start;"><div style="width:30px; height:30px; border-radius:50%; background-color:#e0f4f7; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:16px; margin-right:10px;">🌍</div><div style="font-size:16px; color:#333333;"><strong>Preparing students for an AI-shaped future</strong> as informed users and creators</div></div>

</div>
</div>

</div>
</div>
</body>

